sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client / Advisor
    participant FE as Frontend Dashboard
    participant API as PWM API Gateway
    participant PWM as PWM Service
    participant IMS as Investment Mgmt Service
    participant WHS as WHS Scoring Engine
    participant RE as Recommendation Rule Engine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB

    Client->>FE: Onboard & Link Custodian Account
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/accounts/link
    API->>PWM: Map Linked Account
    PWM->>DB: Save Account Metadata & Status
    PWM->>IMS: Trigger Holdings Sync (Incremental)
    IMS-->>PWM: Return Holdings & Cash Balances
    PWM->>DB: Update Assets Table (Linked Holdings)

    Client->>FE: Input Financial Goal (e.g., Vacation)
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/goals
    API->>PWM: Create Goal (Today Cost, Target Date, Earmarks)
    PWM->>PWM: Calculate Future Value Cost & Compounded Asset Returns
    PWM->>DB: Save Goal (with Future Cost & Shortfall)

    Note over PWM, DB: Scheduled Async Batch Job (Daily)
    DB->>WHS: Fetch Liquid Assets, Debt, Drifts, and Goal Shortfalls
    WHS->>WHS: Compute Sub-Scores & Aggregate WHS
    WHS->>DB: Save WHS Snapshot & History Log
    
    DB->>RE: Fetch Latest Financial Metrics
    RE->>RE: Evaluate Rules (e.g., Emergency Fund Underfunded)
    RE->>DB: Write Active Recommendation Alerts
    
    Client->>FE: Open Dashboard
    FE->>API: GET /api/v1/users/{id}/wealth-health-score
    API->>PWM: Fetch Score & active recommendations
    PWM->>DB: Query snapshots & active alerts
    DB-->>PWM: Return data
    PWM-->>FE: Return JSON Response
    FE->>Client: Render Score meter, charts, & action cards
